+
+/-!
+# UniswapV2ERC20.transferFrom: certified, at the caller 0x2000
+
+The same composition as transfer's (`Certified/Transfer.lean`), for
+`transferFrom(address,address,uint256)` on the exact runtime bytes `CtxGasTF.code`
+(`CtxGasTF.code_eq`: transfer's bytes):
